SY_TALK("d3W9j9TKQO8",[[7,["But if your attention goes higher"]],[11,["– say [as] my attention is. I am only nothing but charity! I mean what am I?"]],[16,["It just flows. You just become the charity."]],[24,["So the difference between"]],[26,["a person who is a realised and a not realised is this"]],[30,["that the attention which was giving myth as reality to you"]],[38,["is gone now, is gone higher."]],[41,["It can see that it is myth."]],[44,["Attention can clearly see that it is myth,"]],[47,["and you can see that yourself and you can remove yourself from them."]],[57,["That, of course, I have to give you a push, no doubt,"]],[60,["and I am working hard on that to give you a push."]],[62,["But you should also know that mythical things must be dropped out,"]],[66,["otherwise you will not grow."]],[69,["All mythical things must be dropped out."]],[73,["And the best way to do it is to be in thoughtless awareness"]],[77,["because as soon as you transcend these three gunas"]],[80,["you become thoughtlessly aware."]],[81,["You have to cross Agya. Once you cross Agya, these three gunas,"]],[86,["absolutely you go into a state where you are gunateet,"]],[90,["you are beyond gunas."]],[94,["So you do not deliberately do anything,"]],[98,["but it just works out."]],[102,["So now for you, because you are enlightened now, is to understand"]],[105,["that our attention has to move higher and higher, at a higher space."]],[113,["Now actually what has happened in Realisation?"]],[117,["Your Kundalini has risen and has come up,"]],[123,["just like, you can say, a small, thin hair, one hair,"]],[134,["and that has broken your Sahastrara"]],[139,["and now the grace is flowing into you."]],[144,["But it’s a very small movement that has taken place, of course"]],[147,["which is a very difficult movement no doubt, but it has taken place."]],[153,["Now you have not expanded like this."]],[159,["Your chakras are only pierced in the centre,"]],[163,["but the rest of the attention is still intact."]],[166,["Actually it is so intact, that you don’t even feel that it is pierced."]],[172,["Now you have to expand that, open it out,"]],[178,["so that more strands of Kundalini can rise"]],[184,["and your attention, which is in these centers, expands."]],[194,["By expansion it drives out all that is mythical on the sides."]],[198,["On every centre we have our attention,"]],[204,["which is being enlightened in the centre"]],[207,["through this Light passing through."]],[211,["But the Light is too small for the darkness that you have collected."]],[217,["Specially for the people of the West, I would say,"]],[220,["your confusions, you must get rid of them."]],[226,["But still you identify."]],[228,["Because if I ask you anything [like], “How are you?”"]],[231,["Means what?"]],[235,["Means you are still confused."]],[239,["Alright?"]],[244,["Confusion should go."]],[247,["One confusion was there that, “This is Realisation or not?”"]],[252,["I hope that’s over now with you people."]],[254,["At least now you believe it is Self-realisation."]],[257,["I had to tell people, “No, you are self-realised now, you are!”"]],[260,["Still they would jump up like [a] jack-in-the-box, you see."]],[264,["They’ll say, “No, we’re not Mother!"]],[266,["How do you say this is Realisation?”"]],[268,["“We expect this out of Realisation and that out of Realisation"]],[272,["– that we’ll be flying out of the door if we are Realised,”"]],[275,["or something nonsensical like that."]],[277,["Thank God, these ideas have gone away."]],[280,["But when we are Realised, there is Light that has come in us,"]],[286,["we have to grow it only by separating our attention"]],[290,["from the myths."]],[294,["It’s all mythical."]],[296,["I also play with you,"]],[298,["because unless and until you are sure,"]],[304,["I am not going to give you a wrong idea about yourself."]],[312,["I want to see how far still your attention is moving,"]],[317,["and I know [that] still you are not sure,"]],[323,["still you are not sure of yourself,"]],[329,["that’s why the confidence is not there."]],[337,["First of all you have to learn how to drive, then you are tested."]],[342,["There will be five stones put together,"]],[345,["the distance will be only that hardly a car can pass through"]],[350,["and the fellow will say, “You bring it zigzag!”"]],[353,["And you cannot do it."]],[355,["Why?"]],[358,["That’s how he makes you a master."]],[364,["The mastery of your attention"]],[368,["will come when you will start seeing that it is all a myth that upsets you."]],[374,["It’s all a myth that upsets you."]],[378,["Just throw it away."]],[382,["Just throw it away and understand"]],[386,["that you are the eternal attention,"]],[392,["that you are the eternal life,"]],[397,["that [the] only thing that keeps you away from it is ignorance,"]],[404,["and the ignorance is too simple to understand:"]],[408,["that you have accepted myth as Truth."]],[414,["Just drop it! It’s all myth!"]],[418,["You’ll be amazed how your attention will rise"]],[425,["and you’ll see all these nonsensical things"]],[429,["which used to frighten you or to elate you,"]],[432,["will drop out, and you will just smile at it."]],[437,["And then only you are going to enjoy yourself fully"]],[442,["because your attention"]],[444,["will be completely drenched into the bliss of Self."]],[452,["I am saying you will, I say you are"]],[458,["already drenched into that bliss."]],[464,["Keep it up."]],[466,["Now, how to do it?"]],[472,["Actually, in every day-to-day life, how to kill the memory of the past?"]],[482,["To kill the memory of the past is to have new memories."]],[489,["You must remember when you got your first Realisation"]],[496,["– always think of it."]],[497,["Whenever any such memory comes to you,"]],[501,["you [should] try to think how you got your Realisation."]],[506,["Any memory that is troublesome or even so-called elating,"]],[512,["you just try to remember how Realisation has come to you."]],[522,["When you feel aggressive about something or angry [about] something,"]],[527,["just try to remember how you felt the joy of surrendering."]],[535,["Just think of that joy of surrendering, of dissolving yourself."]],[542,["So the new memories must be built up."]],[546,["If you start building up new memories,"]],[550,["then you will start collecting moments"]],[554,["to establish other moments which have such memories."]],[565,["Like a memory when you tried to help somebody,"]],[568,["you raised the Kundalini of someone."]],[573,["Now the problem would be when you will be raising the Kundalini of others,"]],[576,["you will be in thoughtless awareness – there won’t be any thought –"]],[580,["and thought is the only thing which impresses."]],[583,["But [at] that time you can record the joy of raising the Kundalini."]],[591,["If you could record the joy of raising the Kundalini of others,"]],[601,["you will feel [that] a new wealth"]],[607,["of these beautiful moments will be accumulated."]],[613,["And all those moments which were giving you confusion"]],[619,["or fear or so-called unhappiness and happiness will drop out"]],[625,["and pure joy will remain."]],[628,["Because now most of the experiences you have had are more of joy."]],[635,["Joy has no thoughts."]],[638,["It’s just an experience, a pratyaksha."]],[646,["That’s why I said you keep your eyes open."]],[652,["I hope you will understand what I mean by that."]],[657,["May God bless you all."]]]);
